From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Market Canopy <office@marketcanopy.invalid>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove the third-party cloud connectors

Market Canopy Office offers one cloud, Market Canopy's own. The Box and
Dropbox connectors signed in through ONLYOFFICE's hosted apps, and the
others pointed at self-hosted servers Market Canopy does not run, so
every upstream provider is deleted. The folder keeps a README so the
build steps that copy it still find it.

Modified by Market Canopy on 2026-10-24 for Market Canopy Office.
---
