+<!--
+Market Canopy Office: the cloud providers folder.
+Copyright (C) 2026 Market Canopy LLC
+SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only (with the additional terms in the
+LICENSE file of https://github.com/marketcanopy/office)
+-->
+
+# Cloud providers
+
+Market Canopy Office ships no third-party cloud connectors: ONLYOFFICE's
+(Box, Dropbox, infomaniak kDrive, Liferay, Moodle, Nextcloud, Odoo,
+ONLYOFFICE, ownCloud, Seafile) were removed on 2026-10-24. The Market Canopy
+provider (`marketcanopy/config.json`) is the only one.
+
+The folder stays because build_tools and the macOS project copy it whole;
+desktop-sdk lists only its subfolders, so this file is never read as a
+provider.
